/* ==== stage UI tokens ==== */
/* Overlay components consume only --gal-ui-*; palettes live on the stage (and on .fork-gal-theme-scope, a
   preview element that shows another theme, e.g. the Config screen's box style cards).
   Paints come from the surface table (surfaces.cjs): every text-bearing stage surface is opaque, so pale and dark
   stages stay readable over any scene; the scene shows only around sheets (through --gal-ui-dim), never behind text. */
