/* The rolling band: a faint lighter band drifts down the tube (about 9 s), then rests off screen (about 6 s). Only its
   transform animates, on its own compositor layer under the glass, in 186 steps (about 20 moves a second): the stage
   idles at 30 fps, and a soft band this faint reads as continuous without asking the compositor for 60. */
.fork-gal-stage[data-theme="crt"]:not([data-fk-skin])::before {
  content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; height: 22%; z-index: 89; pointer-events: none;
