/* 服装 tiles (r3): fixed 80px columns on one left edge; every picture is head-and-shoulders by the same rule (static and
   Live2D, see OUTFIT_BUST / FORK_LIVE2D_FRAMES.bust); each tile carries its own lamp (蓝 / 绿 / 灰), which is what makes
