/* 关闭 reads at a glance — the tile desaturated and dimmed, its name quiet,
   its dot grey. The dot itself is the outfit's lamp control (the one LampMenu: the cast list's lamp button, 22px hit area
   drawn as the same 10px dot on the tile's top-right corner) and opens the 蓝灯 / 绿灯 / 关闭 menu. */
