/* The 编辑 tab's generators (gen-tab redesign): the 立绘 row's dashed ✦ tile and the preview card's ✦. Gated = shown,
   unavailable, its reason as tooltip and as one ⚠ line when clicked; a request in flight / waiting / failed marks the ✦. */
.ap-map-state-gen .ap-map-state-art { position: relative; }
