   upload (the preview card's ⤒ uploads). Where the view can be generated the ✦ is its own button and opens 「生图」. */
.ap-slot-missing { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: inherit; color: var(--emotion-color, var(--fork-accent)); }
