   a host container that is transformed / contained / clipped (the bottom dock) cannot offset or cut them. The .ap-ui
   wrapper only carries tokens and component styles; it adds no box. Order: pack and other dialogs (10000) <
   confirmations (10002) < floating menus (10010) < help tips (10011). All sit above the host's own dialogs (2150). */
