.ap-gen-prompt-open { display: inline-flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 4px 10px; min-height: 30px; }
/* ===== =====
   舞台设置: list rows must not read like their section heading (15px / 650). Item names in the 素材包 and 人物 lists are body
   text — regular weight, a slightly softer ink than the heading — and every section leaves a clear gap below its heading rule
   before the first row. Hover, picking (unchecked → ink-3), missing (warning) and 关闭 (ink-3) colours still win. */
.ap-stage .ap-section-head { margin-bottom: 10px; }
.ap-ui.ap-stage button.ap-pack-name { font-size: var(--fork-fs-body); font-weight: 400; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fork-ink) 84%, transparent); }
.ap-ui.ap-stage .ap-pack-name.is-missing { font-weight: 400; }
.ap-stage .ap-pack-row { min-height: 46px; }
.ap-stage .ap-cast-name { font-size: var(--fork-fs-body); font-weight: 400; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fork-ink) 84%, transparent); }
/* ===== =====
   Every first-level heading of the stage panel folds its section: the title, its count and a quiet chevron are one plain
   button (no box, no fill); the (?) and the head's actions sit outside it. Chevron like 开场设置: down while folded, up while
   open. A folded section keeps its heading rule. */
.ap-ui button.ap-section-toggle { gap: 8px; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; height: auto; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: none; color: inherit; font: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; line-height: inherit; text-align: left; }
.ap-ui button.ap-section-toggle:hover:not(:disabled) { background: none; }
.ap-ui button.ap-section-toggle:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--fork-accent); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }
.ap-section-chevron { display: inline-flex; flex: none; color: var(--fork-ink-3); transition: transform .15s, color .15s; }
.ap-section-chevron > .ap-glyph { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
.ap-section-toggle[aria-expanded=true] > .ap-section-chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }
.ap-ui button.ap-section-toggle:hover > .ap-section-chevron { color: var(--fork-ink-2); }
.ap-section > .ap-section-body[hidden] { display: none; }
.ap-prompt-section > .ap-section-head > h3 > .ap-section-toggle { flex-wrap: wrap; row-gap: 0; }
.ap-prompt-section > .ap-section-head > h3 > .ap-section-toggle > .ap-section-meta { white-space: nowrap; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ap-section-chevron { transition: none; } }
/* ===== =====
   服装 / 差分 headings: 「服装 N (?)」 / 「差分 N (?)」 with the ⋯ at the right end of that same row — a small borderless icon
   button as tall as the heading, on PC and phone alike (no boxed control). The 差分 asset switch is its own full-width row
   under the heading. No action line under the detail blocks: deleting is the heading ⋯'s 「删除…」, a delete mode — the
   heading's end becomes 「已选 N」 · 取消 · 删除 (the 素材库 selection's count and .ap-manage pills; 删除 in the confirm
   dialog's red), each tile carries the house round check (.ap-check-mark) on its top-left corner, a checked tile takes the
   selected ring and a 差分 that cannot be deleted (built-in) is greyed. */
.ap-fe-section > .ap-sub.ap-outfit-head, .ap-fe-section > .ap-sub.ap-emotion-head { flex-wrap: nowrap; }
.ap-fe-section > .ap-sub.ap-emotion-head { margin-bottom: 8px; }
